{
  "title": "Yeasty French Bean Sprouts Ratatouille",
  "description": "A sugar-free, post-workout French dish featuring yeasty, bouncy bean sprouts in a ratatouille form, served in a ti-leaf wrap. This dish is perfect for a healthy and flavorful lunch.",
  "cuisine": "French",
